  "translation": "This afternoon, my mother and I went to the supermarket together. There were many goods in the supermarket. We first went to the fruit section. Mother asked me what fruit I wanted to eat. I said I wanted to eat apples and bananas. Mother bought three apples and two bunches of bananas. Then we went to the drinks section. I saw my favorite juice. I took a glass. Mother also bought some milk. Later we went to the snacks section. My younger brother likes chocolate, so we bought two pieces. Finally we went to check out. The cashier told us how much it was altogether. Mother paid the money. We went home together. We were all very happy."
